/target
node_modules/
/contrib/gandr-vscode/dist
*.vsix
.mise.local.toml
mise.local.lock
/.rumdl_cache
# A global ignore may hide `.cargo`; the build aliases and dist config live
# there and are part of the repository.
!/.cargo/
# Compiler crash dumps carry absolute paths of the machine that built.
rustc-ice-*.txt
/coverage.lcov
/coverage-plain.lcov
# `mise run mutants` outcomes.
/mutants.out
# The features ledger database, built from the tracked `ledger/features.sql`.
/ledger/features.db
/ledger/features.db.new
# `wt:warm`'s clone probe, written outside the tree since #3222; a branch
# forked before it still writes it at the root while the copy runs.
/.wt-warm-probe*
